## Project ticket workflow

This project uses `.ctx/`. Resolve that directory relative to this AGENTS.md, not the shell cwd.
First read `.ctx/config.json` and apply its conversation_language to all conversation,
questions, progress, and reports (code, comments, commits, and documents remain English).
Before substantive work, read `.ctx/index.md` and `.ctx/rules/workflow.md`, then load the
`opencode-gen-ticket` skill unless its current instructions are already in context.
**No ticket, no work:** resume a matching ticket or create one before investigation, research,
implementation, or verification. Bootstrap reads needed to establish a ticket are allowed.
Greetings and clarification-only replies do not require a ticket.
After compaction or session/workspace changes, recover the applicable project workflow and ticket.
Load research/memory skills only when the task requires them. Never preload private data.
When config skills.auto is true, invoke matching coding skills before specialized work;
never load the full installed library. An undecided stack must not be guessed.
Keep ticket history, research, and learned facts in `.ctx/`, not in this file.
